Subject: [PATCH 442/488] [DS4.1] The heads' hidden rows gathered in TileLang

The target's logits rows (hidden_states[logits_indices]) and the
drafter's sample rows (head_hidden[sample_indices]) were torch index
kernels every step. Both go through the CED decoder's TileLang row copy
(packed rows in 16-byte pieces), declared for each model's hidden width.
Tested against torch's indexing.
